# Gestion Annonces Business Rules

- `Product` must already exist before creating any listing.
- `ResourceListing` fields required by default: `title`, `description`, `type`, `quantity`, `unit`, `product_id`, `company_id`. Validate `price`, `location`, `latitude`, and `longitude` when present.
- Listing type is mandatory at creation and drives behavior: `SURPLUS`, `DEMANDE`, `GROUP_BUYING`.
- Create `GroupPurchase` only when `ResourceListing.type = GROUP_BUYING`.
- `GroupPurchase` requires: `target_quantity > 0`, `current_quantity = 0`, future `deadline`, initial status `OPEN`.
- Group statuses must follow spec: `OPEN`, `FULL`, `SUCCESS`, `FAILED`, `CLOSED`. Listing statuses must follow spec: `ACTIVE`, `CLOSED`, `EXPIRED`, `CANCELLED`.
- A seller must never join their own group.
- A company can participate only once in the same group.
- A participant quantity must be strictly positive and must not make total quantity exceed `target_quantity`.
- Reject joins when group or listing is inactive, full, closed, or expired.
- Group success occurs when `current_quantity >= target_quantity` before deadline. Failure occurs when deadline passes before target is reached.
- Quantity updates for group participation must be concurrency-safe.
- `Favorite` must be unique per `user_id` + `listing_id`.
- Support the main flows from the spec: create listing, explore/search, comment, join group, favorite, realtime updates.
